mini-deer-flow
==============

This project is a **teaching reimplementation** of [bytedance/deer-flow](https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow)
("DeerFlow"), an open-source LangGraph super-agent harness.

  - Upstream project:  https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow
  - Upstream license:  MIT (see upstream LICENSE)

A substantial portion of the code in this repository is derived from, or
directly ported from, deer-flow. In accordance with deer-flow's MIT license,
the original copyright notices are retained in this project's [LICENSE](./LICENSE):

    Copyright (c) 2025 Bytedance Ltd. and/or its affiliates
    Copyright (c) 2025-2026 DeerFlow Authors

Modifications and additions specific to mini-deer-flow (simplifications,
teaching-oriented documentation, module restructuring) are:

    Copyright (c) 2026 mini-deer-flow contributors

Intent
------
mini-deer-flow exists for **learning purposes**: it rebuilds deer-flow's agent
harness with smaller code and more detailed, beginner-friendly documentation
(see `docs/`, in simplified Chinese). It is **not** a fork intended to replace
deer-flow, nor is it affiliated with or endorsed by Bytedance. For any
production use, please refer to the upstream deer-flow project.

All third-party dependencies retain their respective licenses (declared in
`backend/packages/harness/pyproject.toml`).
